    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by recorded vote: 189 - 220 (Roll no. 427).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "16:25:17",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "16:16:08",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Rodney Davis (IL) motion to recommit with instructions, pending reservation of a point of order. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment to add a new section to the bill that would require each chief state election official to disclose the identity of any foreign national with access to certain voting materials, including ballots or voting machines. Subsequently, the point of order was withdrawn.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "16:15:09",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Committee on House Administration",
     "systemCode": "hsha00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsha00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Davis, Rodney moved to recommit with instructions to the Committee on House Administration.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "16:14:55",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered as unfinished business. (consideration: CR H5243-5246)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "10:35:56",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "POSTPONED PROCEEDINGS - Pursuant to clause 1(c) of Rule 19, the Chair postponed further proceedings on H.R. 2722.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "10:35:23",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "09:19:26",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 2722.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "09:17:20",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 2722 and H.R. 3351. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 2722 under a closed rule with one hour of general debate. Also, the resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 3351 under a structured rule with one hour of general debate.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H30000",
   "actionDate": "2019-06-27",
   "actionTime": "09:17:15",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 460. (consideration: CR H5207-5223)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
